# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Restaurant Platform v1 — environment example
# Copy to .env for local development. On Vercel, set vars in the dashboard.
#
# ZERO-CONFIG BEHAVIOUR: with no DATABASE_URL at all (e.g. a fresh Vercel
# deploy), the app runs in DEMO_MODE_MEMORY — fully functional, seeded
# in-memory demo data, no database required. Nothing to configure.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Local SQLite persistence (DEMO_MODE — server-persisted demo data).
# Relative paths resolve from prisma/schema.prisma.
DATABASE_URL="file:../db/custom.db"

# Optional: swap the data provider to Supabase (see REBRAND_GUIDE /
# PRODUCTION_HANDOFF for the provider implementation steps).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=""
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=""

# Optional: admin demo passcode (defaults to "demo2026" when unset).
# ADMIN_DEMO_PASSCODE=""
# ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET=""
